    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to add UpSell&#8217;s products to the cart directly from single product page. Using add to cart buttons or checkboxes.<br />\nWhen using button &#8211; you can add a UpSell product directly to the cart without leaving the main product.<br />\nWhen using checkboxes, the UpSells products is addded to the cart same time as the main product.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Unzip the download zip file</li>\n<li>Upload &#8216;woo-upsell&#8217; to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added option to hide out of stock products in the UpSell list.</li>\n<li>Added option to show backorder label for products that are available on backorder.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduces a new &#8216;inline-checkbox-price&#8217; display style for product upsells, allowing the checkbox and price to appear on the same line.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added option to toggle whether the UpSell &#8220;checkbox&#8221; and &#8220;Add to cart button&#8221; should only show on the actual product page.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Made so UpSell &#8220;checkbox&#8221; and &#8220;Add to cart button&#8221; only show on the actual product page. Thanks to @mhscodafweb</li>\n<li>Fixed error where checkboxes in some cases did not add products to cart.</li>\n<li>Made checkbox label clickable.</li>\n<li>Fixed error where &#8220;Add to cart button&#8221; in some cases could not be clicked.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WooCommerce High-Performance Order Storage (HPOS) compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
